    "displayName": "prod: Cloud Run job failing",
    "documentation": {
      "content": "A scheduled Cloud Run job task is failing. reviews-invitation-send runs every minute and relgraph-sync daily; a persistent failure in either is otherwise completely silent. For retailer-ingest-drain, a failure here is an UNEXPECTED exception (the run is recorded as outcome=error in retailer_ingest_runs); stages that end held or failed exit 0 and page through their own retailer-ingest policies instead.",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown"
    },
